# Power Query M: Power Query M formula language specification (Microsoft); requirements/languages/powerquery.md
name     powerquery pq
keyword  let in if then else each and or not as is meta section shared try otherwise error type
type     number text logical date datetime duration table list record function any null binary
builtin  true false null #table #date #datetime Table.SelectRows Table.AddColumn Text.Upper List.Sum
ident-part     .
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/&=<>?.@
calls
